'''Sector G-38''' was a region of space within [[the galaxy]].<ref name="Part One">{{Ahsoka|Part One: Master and Apprentice}}</ref> In [[9 ABY]],<ref name="Date">{{AhsokaSeriesDate}}</ref> a [[New Republic]] [[Defender-class cruiser|''Defender''-class cruiser]], the ''[[Vesper]]'', was traveling through Sector G-38 when it was waylaid by the former [[Jedi]] [[Baylan Skoll]] and his apprentice [[Shin Hati]]. The two claimed to be [[Jedi]], a claim that the ''Vesper''{{'s}} [[Captain]] [[Hayle]] found ridiculous. Hayle invited the two aboard the ship, believing them to be frauds who could be detained after boarding. Although the two were not Jedi, they were [[Force-sensitive]] and were able to dispatch Hayle, the squad that accompanied him to perform the arrest, and the rest of the ship's crew before rescuing the captive [[Morgan Elsbeth]] from the ship.<ref name="Part One" />

